+    "EBAY INSERT CARDS (24 Oct 2026): a printable A6 card for every parcel Sam sends from her personal eBay account — Comfort Creature on the front, thank-you + the free guides + POND10 + a QR code to froglogic.co.uk/?ref=ebay on the back (GoatCounter shows 'ebay' as the source, so we can see if it works). PDF: Frog-Logic-eBay-Insert-Cards.pdf (sent in the chat 24 Oct; 4 cards per A4 sheet, page 1 fronts, page 2 backs, flip on the long edge, cut on the grey lines, 160–250gsm). RULE: the card goes in the box only — eBay bans off-eBay links or addresses in listings, descriptions, messages and feedback, and that's how accounts get restricted.",
